<title>USA: ACM Managed Dollar tender oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>ACM Managed Dollar tender oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>ACM Managed Dollar Income Fund Inc said Friday that about 7,566,417 shares were tendered in its tender offer for 7,081,253 of its shares of common stock.</p>
<p>ACM said that it estimates to proration factor to be 0.936 percent.</p>
<p>The tender offer for about 25 percent of the Fund's outstanding shares expired Thursday.</p>
